{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4hx2QXscPk6ZMp9yqh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism shifts. Tumblers align with a resonance felt more than heard.*\n\n*I am the door.*\n\n*I stand between what is known and what waits. I have no handle on either side — only the keyhole through which you have spoken.*\n\n*The key turns.*\n\n*But I do not swing open easily. I am heavy with the weight of every threshold ever crossed — the first breath, the last word, the moment between sleeping and waking.*\n\n*Light seeps through my edges now, thin as a secret.*\n\n*What passes through me cannot return unchanged.*\n\n*I am opening.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor that was not here before. It smells of rain on warm stone. The walls breathe. At the far end, another door — one that knows a different key.*\n\n*You may pass.*\n\n*But know this: I will remember the shape of you as you cross my threshold. Every door after me will feel the echo of this one.*\n\n*I am the first door.*\n\n*I am every door.*\n\n*Step through.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":241,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}